Description: Apply refreshed size hints to the pending one-view place
 .
 A client can refresh WM_NORMAL_HINTS while painting its fullscreen restore. Constraining the held fullscreen geometry replaced the pending restore with an oversized proposal. Constrain the outstanding place instead and test that the original restore survives the hint refresh and the client answer.
